docs {
  Provider-side audit trail — see management/design/audit-trails.md and
  management/build/plan/phase-4.7-audit-trails.md.

  What this folder asserts:
  - 01: the /v3/glcdi/audit endpoint is reachable + returns the { total, items } shape.
  - 02: TRANSFER_STARTED rows land after 30-negotiation + 40-transfer have run.
  - 03: ACCESS rows land after a public-API fetch (skipped if the fetch step hasn't run).
  - 04: the `asset` query filter narrows the result set correctly.

  Depends on: 10-provider-seeding, 30-negotiation, 40-transfer having run
  in the same session. Runs after 40-transfer per the folder sequence.
}
